WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.934
-The slim new Republican
majority in the House

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:04.701
is now trying to move on
after last week's

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:07.234
unprecedented meltdown
with an incredibly weak speaker,

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:10.367
Kevin McCarthy, who has openly
admitted that he's indebted

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:11.934
to Donald Trump
for his position,

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:13.701
even though it was
Trump himself

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:15.367
who tanked the party
in the midterms

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:16.734
and gave them such
a narrow majority.

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:18.901
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:23.167
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:25.000
The new Republican majority
in the House

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.067
is finally getting to work
after a week of paralyzing chaos

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.334
in which newly minted

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:31.501
Speaker of the House
Kevin McCarthy acceded --

00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:34.234
in fact, one could even say,
capitulated,

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:37.334
to the demands of the far-right
extremists in the caucus.

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:40.234
And, just to give you an idea
of how nuts the next two years

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:42.434
are going to be
with this crew in charge,

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:45.167
one of the newly elected members
of McCarthy's conference

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:47.701
is Montana
Republican Ryan Zinke,

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:50.067
who was Donald Trump's
first interior secretary,

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:52.734
until he was forced to resign
after a series of scandals,

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:55.701
including a real estate deal,
conflicts of interest, and a...

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:02.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:05.033
First of all, I'm surprised
Mike Pence would ever engage

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:07.601
in such an unnatural activity
as horseback riding.

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:08.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:10.601
[ As Pence ]
Man and beast were not meant

00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:13.167
to consort in such
a devilish fashion.

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:14.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:17.767
Also, I can't imagine Pence
riding a regular trail horse.

00:01:17.767 --> 00:01:19.200
He seems to have more

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.200
of a dressage horse
kind of vibe.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.300
I mean, have you
ever seen him run? He...

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:25.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:28.801
...prances like one of those
stallions at the Olympics.

00:01:28.801 --> 00:01:30.234
I mean, look at him.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:33.667
Also, you guys, clapping while
running is not a good look.

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:35.567
[ Laughter ]
He looks like he should be

00:01:35.567 --> 00:01:38.100
holding two coconuts,
Monty Python-style.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.501
I'm guessing this is what
Trump had in mind

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:45.300
when he sicced that mob
on Pence on January 6th.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.734
[ As Trump ]
He's faster than he looks,
but the clapping,

00:01:47.734 --> 00:01:49.667
the clapping gives away
his location.

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:52.601
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ Panting ]

00:01:57.434 --> 00:01:58.133
Aah!

00:01:58.133 --> 00:02:00.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.801 --> 00:02:03.067
Anyway, Trump's scandal-plagued
interior secretary

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:05.968
is now a member of the new
GOP majority in the House

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:07.467
and, when he took
to the floor this week

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:09.801
for his first speech
as a member of Congress,

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:12.200
he made clear that this
new Republican conference

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.367
is going to be
pretty far out there

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:17.167
when he claimed that
a secret cabal of leftists

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:19.601
is running the government
from behind the scenes.

00:02:19.601 --> 00:02:21.300
Now, Republicans say stuff
like that all the time,

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.434
but Zinke had
a different spin on it

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:25.467
when he identified
a new target

00:02:25.467 --> 00:02:28.634
that the leftist deep state
is supposedly after.

00:02:28.634 --> 00:02:31.467
-I stand before you
as a duly elected member

00:02:31.467 --> 00:02:33.067
of the United States Congress

00:02:33.067 --> 00:02:36.200
and tell you that
a deep state exists

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.934
and it is perhaps
the strongest covert weapon

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:41.868
the left has
against the American people.

00:02:41.868 --> 00:02:43.601
There is no doubt

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:46.033
the federal government
deep state coordinates

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:49.234
with liberal activists
and uses politicians

00:02:49.234 --> 00:02:52.133
and willing media
to carry their water.

00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:55.100
The deep state runs
secret messaging campaigns

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:58.434
with one goal in mind --
to increase its power

00:02:58.434 --> 00:03:01.834
to censor and persuade
the American people.

00:03:01.834 --> 00:03:03.567
Dark money groups funded

00:03:03.567 --> 00:03:06.467
by liberal billionaires
and foreign investors

00:03:06.467 --> 00:03:08.534
funnel money
to shell organizations

00:03:08.534 --> 00:03:12.267
and repeatedly attempt
to destroy the American West.

00:03:12.267 --> 00:03:14.100
In many cases,
they want to wipe out

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:16.367
the American cowboy completely.

00:03:16.367 --> 00:03:19.968
-You think the American cowboy
is getting wiped out?

00:03:19.968 --> 00:03:22.367
Have you not heard
about "Yellowstone"?

00:03:22.367 --> 00:03:23.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:27.067
This is the best four-year run
for American cowboys

00:03:27.067 --> 00:03:29.067
since it was legal
to advertise cigarettes.

00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:30.534
[ Laughter ]
Do you know --

00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:32.868
Do you know how many people
in America watch "Yellowstone"?

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:34.601
Every single dad.

00:03:34.601 --> 00:03:36.334
[ Laughter ]
And, just a word
to those dads --

00:03:36.334 --> 00:03:37.834
when you talk to your kids
on the phone,

00:03:37.834 --> 00:03:40.334
you don't have to tell them,
every single time,

00:03:40.334 --> 00:03:42.601
that Beth Dutton
is a real number.

00:03:42.601 --> 00:03:43.834
[ Laughter ]
Not that she isn't.

00:03:43.834 --> 00:03:45.434
It's just weird
that you keep telling us

00:03:45.434 --> 00:03:46.801
and that you whisper
when you do it,

00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:49.367
like you don't want Mom to hear
because, newsflash, dude,

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:52.501
she'd trade you in
for Kevin Costner yesterday.

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:54.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.667
I'm sorry. I shouldn't be
so hard on my dad.

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:57.667
I mean, I get it.

00:03:57.667 --> 00:03:59.801
[ Laughter ]
I'm a dad now

00:03:59.801 --> 00:04:02.167
and, as a dad,
I just want to say

00:04:02.167 --> 00:04:03.801
that Beth Dutton
is a real number.

00:04:03.801 --> 00:04:05.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:05.601 --> 00:04:07.133
But I'll give Zinke credit.

00:04:07.133 --> 00:04:09.434
The deep state wants to cancel
cowboys is a new one.

00:04:09.434 --> 00:04:11.667
Usually, they're like,
"The army is woke now,"

00:04:11.667 --> 00:04:14.467
or "The socialist mob is trying
to cancel conservatives."

00:04:14.467 --> 00:04:17.133
But now, I guess, the idea is
that the CIA, the FBI,

00:04:17.133 --> 00:04:19.868
and the Pentagon all get
together behind closed doors

00:04:19.868 --> 00:04:22.267
with AOC, antifa,
and Bernie Sanders

00:04:22.267 --> 00:04:24.734
[ Laughter ]
to plot how
to eliminate cowboys.

00:04:24.734 --> 00:04:27.601
[ As Sanders ]
No one person should have
a ten-gallon hat.

00:04:27.601 --> 00:04:29.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:29.434 --> 00:04:32.501
When, in fact, ten people should
all have a one-gallon hat.

00:04:32.501 --> 00:04:33.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:33.467 --> 00:04:36.300
How many gallons
does one hat need?

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:39.534
99% of the people shouldn't have
0% of the gallons.

00:04:39.534 --> 00:04:42.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:44.334 --> 00:04:46.968
So, that's a window
into how unhinged

00:04:46.968 --> 00:04:48.601
the next two years
are going to be

00:04:48.601 --> 00:04:50.133
with these loons
in charge of the House.

00:04:50.133 --> 00:04:52.167
And it makes sense
that Republicans have revived

00:04:52.167 --> 00:04:53.601
one of Trump's disgraced cronies

00:04:53.601 --> 00:04:55.767
because Kevin McCarthy himself
is personally indebted to Trump.

00:04:55.767 --> 00:04:57.067
The drama
that unfolded last week

00:04:57.067 --> 00:05:00.501
was essentially an extension
of the ongoing GOP war

00:05:00.501 --> 00:05:01.934
between establishment
Republicans

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:04.868
and the Trump wing of the party,
and the Trump wing won.

00:05:04.868 --> 00:05:07.334
In fact, after McCarthy finally
crawled over the finish line,

00:05:07.334 --> 00:05:10.300
on the 15th ballot,
by yielding...

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.467
[ Laughter ]
...perhaps even relenting,

00:05:13.467 --> 00:05:15.367
to the demands of the MAGA wing
of his party,

00:05:15.367 --> 00:05:17.567
McCarthy openly thanked Trump
for his support.

00:05:17.567 --> 00:05:20.300
-The fight that Kevin McCarthy
is having right now

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.801
is a continuation
of the GOP civil war

00:05:22.801 --> 00:05:24.300
and these conservatives
are saying to themselves,

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.834
"Well, we need to fight now.

00:05:25.834 --> 00:05:27.667
We need to put a marker down now

00:05:27.667 --> 00:05:29.934
so that, if he does
pick up the gavel,

00:05:29.934 --> 00:05:32.701
McCarthy is not going
to so easily acquiesce

00:05:32.701 --> 00:05:34.801
to everything that the Biden
administration wants."

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:37.667
-I do want to especially
thank President Trump.

00:05:37.667 --> 00:05:38.834
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:05:38.834 --> 00:05:40.234
I don't think
you should doubt --

00:05:40.234 --> 00:05:42.534
anybody should doubt
his influence.

00:05:42.534 --> 00:05:44.334
He was with me
from the beginning.

00:05:44.334 --> 00:05:46.634
Somebody wrote the doubt
of whether he was there

00:05:46.634 --> 00:05:48.000
and he was all-in.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.300
He would call me
and he would call others.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.000
And he really was --

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.567
I was just talking
to him tonight --

00:05:54.567 --> 00:05:56.267
helping get those final votes.

00:05:56.267 --> 00:05:58.400
And he was a great influence
to make that all happen.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.467
So, thank you, President Trump.

00:06:00.467 --> 00:06:02.501
-I actually believe that
because the only thing

00:06:02.501 --> 00:06:04.667
