making phone calls.

00:06:04.667 --> 00:06:06.968
Remember when he used to call in
to "Fox &amp; Friends"

00:06:06.968 --> 00:06:08.300
[ Laughter ]
and just ramble for a full hour,

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.501
while the hosts sat there,
frozen,

00:06:10.501 --> 00:06:12.300
like they were watching
Mike Pence run?

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:14.133 --> 00:06:16.100
Making calls
is Trump's only skill.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.934
All he has to do is sit there
in his pajamas,

00:06:17.934 --> 00:06:19.901
in front of his television,
and ramble for an hour

00:06:19.901 --> 00:06:21.367
