I'll vote for Kevin.

00:06:25.501 --> 00:06:28.701
Just stop talking about how
many times you have to flush."

00:06:28.701 --> 00:06:30.501
[ Laughter ]
Incidentally,
Kevin McCarthy needed

00:06:30.501 --> 00:06:32.634
