to become speaker

00:06:32.634 --> 00:06:35.567
as the number of times
Trump needs to flush his toilet.

00:06:35.567 --> 00:06:39.400
People are flushing toilets
10 times, 15 times,

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:40.634
[ Laughter and applause ]
as opposed to once.

00:06:40.634 --> 00:06:42.934
-See?
15 ballots, 15 flushes.

00:06:42.934 --> 00:06:44.567
No wonder these guys
are best buds.

00:06:45.434 --> 00:06:46.801
[ As Trump ]
Don't feel bad, Kevin.

00:06:46.801 --> 00:06:47.801
Don't feel bad.

00:06:47.801 --> 00:06:49.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:49.434 --> 00:06:50.901
If it took 15 times,

00:06:50.901 --> 00:06:52.934
that just means
you're a giant turd.

00:06:52.934 --> 00:06:56.367
[ Laughter and applause ]
Now, here's the crazy part --

00:06:56.367 --> 00:06:57.734
Trump is, arguably, the reason

00:06:57.734 --> 00:06:59.334
McCarthy was in this position,
to begin with.

00:06:59.334 --> 00:07:01.601
Trump and his cult
of MAGA weirdos

00:07:01.601 --> 00:07:03.167
