expectations

00:07:07.267 --> 00:07:09.334
and there very well could've
been a red wave,

00:07:09.334 --> 00:07:10.734
as pundits were predicting.

00:07:10.734 --> 00:07:12.367
And, if there had been
a red wave,

00:07:12.367 --> 00:07:14.601
McCarthy would've had a much
larger margin in the House,

00:07:14.601 --> 00:07:16.567
instead of the tiny margin
he has now.

00:07:16.567 --> 00:07:18.133
In which case,
he wouldn't have needed

00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:19.834
to spend four days begging
and pleading

00:07:19.834 --> 00:07:22.000
with a small group of extremists
in his party to support him.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.634
In short, if Trump hadn't
wrecked the Republican Party,

00:07:24.634 --> 00:07:27.400
McCarthy probably would've
only needed to run

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:29.100
for speaker one time,
as opposed to...

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.133
-Fifteen times.

00:07:30.133 --> 00:07:32.234
[ Laughter and applause ]
And yet,

00:07:32.234 --> 00:07:34.000
by tanking the party
in the midterms

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.968
and reigniting a civil war
within the GOP,

00:07:35.968 --> 00:07:37.701
Trump has somehow wormed
his way back

00:07:37.701 --> 00:07:38.968
into a position of influence

00:07:38.968 --> 00:07:40.400
with the new speaker
of the House

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:42.267
and his gang of bozos
and doofuses,

00:07:42.267 --> 00:07:43.567
like Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:07:43.567 --> 00:07:45.300
who has been calling
for Joe Biden to be impeached,

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:47.234
