00:08:17.767 --> 00:08:18.834
-[ As Greene ]
Oh, my gosh.

00:08:18.834 --> 00:08:20.200
First of all,
it's funny to me that,

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:21.567
[ Laughter ]
because she's in the
majority now,

00:08:21.567 --> 00:08:23.367
