00:08:29.033 --> 00:08:30.367
[ Laughter ]

00:08:30.367 --> 00:08:31.667
[ As Greene ]
Oh, my gosh.
Well, I do declare

00:08:31.667 --> 00:08:33.267
that we must ever so kindly

00:08:33.267 --> 00:08:36.200
[ Laughter ]
impeach Mr. Joseph R. Biden.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.667
Now, would you all like
a biscuit and a glass
of sweet tea?

00:08:38.667 --> 00:08:40.300
[ Laughter ]
Now, you've all heard
about the Mar-A-Lago search

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:42.367
that turned up
stolen classified documents.

00:08:42.367 --> 00:08:44.534
Well, this week, we also learned
that lawyers for Biden

00:08:44.534 --> 00:08:47.801
