and had the documents returned.

00:08:52.934 --> 00:08:54.601
And then, right as we started
taping this show,

00:08:54.601 --> 00:08:57.501
we found out that Biden aides
had found a second batch

00:08:57.501 --> 00:08:59.534
of classified documents
in a new location,

00:08:59.534 --> 00:09:00.968
with NBC News reporting that...

00:09:05.801 --> 00:09:07.300
So, we don't know
all the details, yet,

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.234
and, as they come out,
we'll definitely discuss them,

00:09:09.234 --> 00:09:12.167
but, so far, the two situations
seem very different.

00:09:12.167 --> 00:09:16.200
-The difference here is that,
according to the White House,

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:20.067
it was the president's legal
team that reached out to NARA

00:09:20.067 --> 00:09:24.300
