as opposed to with Trump,

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:26.501
who fought,
for months and months,

00:09:26.501 --> 00:09:28.067
not to turn over documents

00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:30.801
that the archive said needed
to be turned over.

00:09:30.801 --> 00:09:32.901
The FBI said
it obtained evidence

00:09:32.901 --> 00:09:35.667
showing that boxes of documents
were being moved

00:09:35.667 --> 00:09:38.400
from a storage room where they
were supposed to be kept

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.334
and that prompted
the Justice Department

00:09:40.334 --> 00:09:43.033
to open an obstruction
investigation

00:09:43.033 --> 00:09:45.100
and conduct
the extraordinary search

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.634
of Trump's Mar-A-Lago resort,
where, the FBI says,

00:09:48.634 --> 00:09:51.167
they found even more
classified documents.

00:09:51.167 --> 00:09:53.868
-So, a few similarities,
but mostly, huge differences.

00:09:53.868 --> 00:09:56.234
Calling them the same is like
calling both of these guys

00:09:56.234 --> 00:09:57.300
Olympic sprinters.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:10:00.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:02.167 --> 00:10:05.300
When Biden's lawyers found
the small number of documents,

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.400
they immediately
turned them over.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:07.868
Trump, on the other hand,
kept refusing

00:10:07.868 --> 00:10:10.367
and the FBI kept finding more
documents, totaling over 300,

00:10:10.367 --> 00:10:12.934
even after Trump claimed
he'd handed them all over.

00:10:12.934 --> 00:10:14.234
He was even moving boxes

00:10:14.234 --> 00:10:16.133
of classified documents around,
for some reason,

00:10:16.133 --> 00:10:18.067
which is suspicious,
no matter what's inside.

00:10:18.067 --> 00:10:19.734
If I had a box
that I kept moving

00:10:19.734 --> 00:10:21.601
every time my wife asked me
to get rid of it,

00:10:21.601 --> 00:10:23.200
she'd start to get curious,

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.501
even though I clearly
labeled it...

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:31.934
Biden voluntarily handed them
over without even being asked.

00:10:31.934 --> 00:10:33.133
Trump, on the other hand,
was given

00:10:33.133 --> 00:10:35.300
multiple opportunities
to come clean and refused

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:38.100
and, yet, that has not stopped
newly empowered Republicans

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:40.801
from equating the two situations
in the dumbest way possible.

00:10:40.801 --> 00:10:43.968
-Why aren't they in there
right now, with subpoenas,

00:10:43.968 --> 00:10:46.300
going through every single
record there?

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:48.167
-Where's the raid?!
-Classified documents.

00:10:48.167 --> 00:10:49.400
Right.
Where is the raid?

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.701
And let me -- let me --
-Where's the FBI raid?

00:10:50.701 --> 00:10:53.367
-We have a quote here
from Representative James Comer,

00:10:53.367 --> 00:10:55.434
from the Oversight Committee,
who said...

00:10:59.767 --> 00:11:01.801
-Monday night,
in a post, Trump asked...

00:11:07.501 --> 00:11:09.868
-The FBI doesn't raid someone

00:11:09.868 --> 00:11:12.000
[ Laughing ]
who's already cooperating.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.801
[ Laughter ]
"FBI! We're here
for the documents!"

00:11:13.801 --> 00:11:15.968
Oh, yeah, we, um,
turned them in yesterday.

00:11:15.968 --> 00:11:17.234
"Oh!

00:11:17.234 --> 00:11:19.300
[ Laughter ]

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:22.300
Oh, okay."

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:23.133
You seem bummed.

00:11:23.133 --> 00:11:26.601
"Yeah, no, it's just, uh...

00:11:26.601 --> 00:11:29.334
...we put on our windbreakers,
and everything, and, um --

00:11:29.334 --> 00:11:30.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:30.634 --> 00:11:31.934
Would you mind?
Is this dumb?

00:11:31.934 --> 00:11:32.934
Can we kick in your door?

00:11:32.934 --> 00:11:34.033
No, it is dumb.

00:11:34.033 --> 00:11:36.100
[ Laughter ]

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.334
We're going to go!"

00:11:38.334 --> 00:11:40.167
The only way
it would ever make sense

00:11:40.167 --> 00:11:42.834
to raid someone who's
cooperating with the feds is

00:11:42.834 --> 00:11:45.300
if they're a secret
undercover informant

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.968
and you're trying to maintain
their cover,

00:11:46.968 --> 00:11:49.367
but I don't think that's
the case here because Biden --

00:11:49.367 --> 00:11:51.434
look, Biden would make
a bad undercover cop.

00:11:51.434 --> 00:11:52.934
[ Laughter ]
He's too loud.

00:11:52.934 --> 00:11:54.200
He makes too many gaffes.

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:55.334
[ As Biden ]
Hey, you guys doing

00:11:55.334 --> 00:11:56.901
an illegal drug deal here?

00:11:56.901 --> 00:11:58.167
I like illegal drugs.

00:11:58.167 --> 00:11:59.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:59.567 --> 00:12:02.067
Why don't you guys sell me some
of those illegal drugs?

00:12:02.067 --> 00:12:02.934
I'm not a cop.

00:12:02.934 --> 00:12:03.934
I'm just your average...

00:12:03.934 --> 00:12:05.300
-American cowboy.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.701
[ Laughter and applause ]
Of course,

00:12:07.701 --> 00:12:09.834
even then,
Biden would trip on the stairs

00:12:09.834 --> 00:12:11.801
and his secret microphone
would fall out

00:12:11.801 --> 00:12:14.601
[ Laughter and applause ]
and he'd yell for backup.

00:12:14.601 --> 00:12:15.868
[ As Biden ]
Scorpio! Scorpio!

00:12:15.868 --> 00:12:16.868
My cover's blown!

00:12:16.868 --> 00:12:18.033
Get me outta here!

00:12:18.033 --> 00:12:19.934
[ Laughter ]
I'm on the tenth stair!

00:12:19.934 --> 00:12:20.934
Ninth stair!

00:12:20.934 --> 00:12:22.501
Tenth stair.
Nine, eight!

00:12:22.501 --> 00:12:25.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:25.634 --> 00:12:26.901
For the next two years,

00:12:26.901 --> 00:12:28.734
we're going to have
a narrow Republican majority led

00:12:28.734 --> 00:12:30.801
by a historically weak speaker
of the House,

00:12:30.801 --> 00:12:32.601
captive to far-right extremists

00:12:32.601 --> 00:12:34.934
and indebted to an ex-president
who stoked an insurrection

00:12:34.934 --> 00:12:37.567
because Trump tanked the GOP
in the midterms

00:12:37.567 --> 00:12:40.501
and McCarthy is now the most
feeble speaker in modern memory.

00:12:40.501 --> 00:12:42.167
If not for Trump,
McCarthy would probably be

00:12:42.167 --> 00:12:44.901
a much stronger speaker,
with a much stronger majority.

00:12:44.901 --> 00:12:46.467
When the extremists
made their demands,

00:12:46.467 --> 00:12:47.467
he wouldn't have had to...

00:12:47.467 --> 00:12:48.467
-Acquiesce.

00:12:48.467 --> 00:12:49.300
[ Laughter ]
-...and he certainly

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:50.300
wouldn't have had to do it...

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:51.434
-Fifteen times.

00:12:51.434 --> 00:12:54.501
[ Laughter and applause ]
[Indistinct]

00:12:54.501 --> 00:12:56.934
[ Cheering ]

00:12:57.767 --> 00:12:59.467
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:59.467 --> 00:13:03.300
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

